-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Are_Sesame_Seeds_Gluten_Free_Why" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="Are Sesame Seeds Gluten Free">Are Sesame Seeds Gluten Free</span>? Warum?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Do_Black_and_White_Sesame_Seeds_Both_Contain_Gluten" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Do Black and White Sesame Seeds Both Contain Gluten">Do Black and White Sesame Seeds Both Contain Gluten</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#How_to_Identify_Sesame_Seed_Products_That_Do_Not_Contain_Gluten" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="How to Identify Sesame Seed Products That Do Not Contain Gluten">How to Identify Sesame Seed Products That Do Not Contain Gluten</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Are_All_Sesame_Seed_Products_Processed_in_the_Food_Industry_Gluten-Free" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="Are All Sesame Seed Products Processed in the Food Industry Gluten-Free">Are All Sesame Seed Products Processed in the Food Industry Gluten-Free</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Do_Sesame_Seed_Paste_and_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Contain_Gluten" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="Do Sesame Seed Paste and Sesame Seed Oil Contain Gluten">Do Sesame Seed Paste and Sesame Seed Oil Contain Gluten</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Do_Products_Make_with_Sesame_Seeds_as_Ingredients_Contain_Gluten" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Do Products Make with Sesame Seeds as Ingredients Contain Gluten">Do Products Make with Sesame Seeds as Ingredients Contain Gluten</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#Reference" >Referenz</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_is_Sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="What is Sesame">What is Sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame">Sesame</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="scientific name">scientific name</span>: <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Sesamum indicum">Sesamum indicum</span></em>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="is an annual upright herbaceous plant belonging to the Pedaliaceae family">is an annual upright herbaceous plant belonging to the Pedaliaceae family</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="It is native to Asia">It is native to Asia</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="particularly India">particularly India</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="and has a long cultivation history">and has a long cultivation history</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="having been introduced to China via the Silk Road during the Han Dynasty">having been introduced to China via the Silk Road during the Han Dynasty</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seeds contain over">Sesame seeds contain over</span> 50% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="oil and are an important oilseed crop">oil and are an important oilseed crop</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="the oil extracted is aromatic and commonly used in cooking and food processing">the oil extracted is aromatic and commonly used in cooking and food processing</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame is not only a vital source of cooking oil but also has various uses">Sesame is not only a vital source of cooking oil but also has various uses</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame oil is rich in antioxidants like sesamol and sesaminol">Sesame oil is rich in antioxidants like sesamol and sesaminol</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="which have anti-cancer and health benefits">which have anti-cancer and health benefits</span>. Zusätzlich, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="sesame is widely used in traditional medicine for treating conditions like hypertension">sesame is widely used in traditional medicine for treating conditions like hypertension</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="diabetes">diabetes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="and inflammation">and inflammation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="It can also be processed into various food products">It can also be processed into various food products</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="such as sesame paste">such as sesame paste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="sesame candy">sesame candy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="and sesame powder">and sesame powder</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="making it an essential ingredient in baking and confectionery">making it an essential ingredient in baking and confectionery</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame is highly adaptable to different environments and can grow in tropical">Sesame is highly adaptable to different environments and can grow in tropical</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="subtropical">subtropical</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="and even temperate regions">and even temperate regions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="demonstrating significant drought resistance">demonstrating significant drought resistance</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="Major sesame-producing countries or regions include India">Major sesame-producing countries or regions include India</span>, China, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Turkey">Turkey</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="and the Caribbean">and the Caribbean</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Due to its high nutritional value and versatility">Due to its high nutritional value and versatility</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="sesame holds significant economic value globally">sesame holds significant economic value globally</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_is_Gluten_In_Which_Food_Ingredients_is_it_found"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="What is Gluten">What is Gluten</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="In Which Food Ingredients is it found">In Which Food Ingredients is it found</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten is a protein found in grains such as wheat">Gluten is a protein found in grains such as wheat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="barley">barley</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="and rye">and rye</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="primarily composed of gliadin and glutenin">primarily composed of gliadin and glutenin</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="This protein gives elasticity to dough">This protein gives elasticity to dough</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="allowing it to rise and imparting a chewy texture to baked goods">allowing it to rise and imparting a chewy texture to baked goods</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten is widely present in various food ingredients">Gluten is widely present in various food ingredients</span>, einschließlich, aber nicht beschränkt auf:</p><ul><li><strong>Körner:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="Whole wheat">Whole wheat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="bran">bran</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="barley">barley</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="rye">rye</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="oats">oats</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="spelt">spelt</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="kamut">kamut</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="and durum wheat">and durum wheat</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Flour products">Flour products</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="High-gluten flour">High-gluten flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="whole wheat flour">whole wheat flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="wheat germ">wheat germ</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="and whole grain flours">and whole grain flours</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Processed foods">Processed foods</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Many processed foods such as bread">Many processed foods such as bread</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="pizza crusts">pizza crusts</span>, Pasta, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="beer">beer</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="and condiments">and condiments</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="like soy sauce and salad dressings">like soy sauce and salad dressings</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="may also contain gluten">may also contain gluten</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Other foods">Other foods</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Some candies">Some candies</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="chocolate bars">chocolate bars</span>, Würstchen, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="dairy products">dairy products</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="especially those containing oat or cookie pieces">especially those containing oat or cookie pieces</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="and seasoning mixes">and seasoning mixes</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="It&#8217;s important to note that even products labeled as gluten-free may contain trace amounts of gluten due to cross-contamination">It&#8217;s important to note that even products labeled as gluten-free may contain trace amounts of gluten due to cross-contamination</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="so those with gluten sensitivity or intolerance should carefully check food labels and avoid cross-contamination">so those with gluten sensitivity or intolerance should carefully check food labels and avoid cross-contamination</span>.</p><figure id="attachment_630-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-630-2" style="width: 686px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Are-sesame-seeds-gluten-free-300x181.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-630" alt="Are sesame seeds gluten free" width="696" height="420" title="Sind Sesamsamen glutenfrei?? 5" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-630-2" class="wp-caption-text">Sind Sesamsamen glutenfrei?</figcaption></figure><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_Harms_of_Gluten"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="What are the Harms of Gluten">What are the Harms of Gluten</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten is harmless for most people">Gluten is harmless for most people</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="but for certain individuals">but for certain individuals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="especially those with celiac disease or gluten sensitivity">especially those with celiac disease or gluten sensitivity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="it can lead to a range of health issues">it can lead to a range of health issues</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Celiac disease">Celiac disease</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="This is a genetic autoimmune disorder in which ingestion of gluten leads to an immune response damaging the small intestine&#8217;s villi">This is a genetic autoimmune disorder in which ingestion of gluten leads to an immune response damaging the small intestine&#8217;s villi</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="resulting in malabsorption of nutrients">resulting in malabsorption of nutrients</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="Untreated">Untreated</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="it can lead to malnutrition">it can lead to malnutrition</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="anemia">anemia</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="osteoporosis">osteoporosis</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="infertility">infertility</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="and intestinal cancer">and intestinal cancer</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="Non-celiac gluten sensitivity">Non-celiac gluten sensitivity</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="A less common condition where individuals experience symptoms similar to celiac disease upon gluten ingestion">A less common condition where individuals experience symptoms similar to celiac disease upon gluten ingestion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="such as diarrhea">such as diarrhea</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="abdominal pain">abdominal pain</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="and bloating">and bloating</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="Although the symptoms are not as severe as in celiac disease">Although the symptoms are not as severe as in celiac disease</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="avoiding gluten is still necessary to alleviate symptoms">avoiding gluten is still necessary to alleviate symptoms</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="Neurological effects">Neurological effects</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="Some studies suggest that gluten sensitivity may be linked to various neurological diseases">Some studies suggest that gluten sensitivity may be linked to various neurological diseases</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="such as Alzheimer’s">such as Alzheimer’s</span>, Parkinson, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="and depression">and depression</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="potentially affecting brain health through inflammatory responses and immune system dysregulation">potentially affecting brain health through inflammatory responses and immune system dysregulation</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="Other health issues">Other health issues</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="Chronic overconsumption of gluten may lead to indigestion">Chronic overconsumption of gluten may lead to indigestion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="allergic reactions">allergic reactions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="and gastrointestinal disorders">and gastrointestinal disorders</span>. Zusätzlich, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="gluten&#8217;s sticky components can interfere with nutrient absorption">gluten&#8217;s sticky components can interfere with nutrient absorption</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="trigger immune responses">trigger immune responses</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="and cause inflammation and elevated cytokines">and cause inflammation and elevated cytokines</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="harming the gut and other organs">harming the gut and other organs</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="While gluten is safe for most people">While gluten is safe for most people</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="avoiding it is necessary for specific groups">avoiding it is necessary for specific groups</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="particularly those with celiac disease and gluten intolerance">particularly those with celiac disease and gluten intolerance</span>. Jedoch, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="blindly following a gluten-free diet may not be suitable for everyone">blindly following a gluten-free diet may not be suitable for everyone</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="as it could lead to nutritional imbalances and other health issues">as it could lead to nutritional imbalances and other health issues</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_Sesame_Seeds_Gluten_Free_Why"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="Are Sesame Seeds Gluten Free">Are Sesame Seeds Gluten Free</span>? Warum?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame does not contain gluten">Sesame does not contain gluten</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="This is because gluten is primarily found in grains such as wheat">This is because gluten is primarily found in grains such as wheat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="rye">rye</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="and barley">and barley</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="whereas sesame belongs to the seed category of foods and typically does not contain gluten">whereas sesame belongs to the seed category of foods and typically does not contain gluten</span>. Außerdem, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="sesame and its products are explicitly categorized as safe ingredients in gluten-free foods">sesame and its products are explicitly categorized as safe ingredients in gluten-free foods</span>. Daher, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="sesame can be included in a gluten-free diet without posing issues for those with gluten sensitivity or Crohn’s disease">sesame can be included in a gluten-free diet without posing issues for those with gluten sensitivity or Crohn’s disease</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_Black_and_White_Sesame_Seeds_Both_Contain_Gluten"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="Do Black and White Sesame Seeds Both Contain Gluten">Do Black and White Sesame Seeds Both Contain Gluten</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="Both black and white sesame seeds do not contain gluten">Both black and white sesame seeds do not contain gluten</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten is a protein mainly found in wheat">Gluten is a protein mainly found in wheat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="barley">barley</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="and rye">and rye</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="and sesame does not fall into these grain categories">and sesame does not fall into these grain categories</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="From a taxonomical perspective">From a taxonomical perspective</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="sesame is distinct from gluten-containing grains">sesame is distinct from gluten-containing grains</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="and its seeds do not contain gluten">and its seeds do not contain gluten</span>. Zusätzlich, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="the information does not indicate that sesame contains gluten">the information does not indicate that sesame contains gluten</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="On the contrary">On the contrary</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="sesame is widely regarded as a low-allergen food">sesame is widely regarded as a low-allergen food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_145" data-source="" data-orig="commonly used to produce gluten-free products">commonly used to produce gluten-free products</span>. daher, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="it can be confirmed that both black and white sesame seeds do not contain gluten">it can be confirmed that both black and white sesame seeds do not contain gluten</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Identify_Sesame_Seed_Products_That_Do_Not_Contain_Gluten"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="How to Identify Sesame Seed Products That Do Not Contain Gluten">How to Identify Sesame Seed Products That Do Not Contain Gluten</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_631-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-631-2" style="width: 710px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/do-sesame-seeds-gluten-free-300x189.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-631" alt="Are sesame seeds gluten free" width="720" height="454" title="Sind Sesamsamen glutenfrei?? 6" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-631-2" class="wp-caption-text">Sind Sesamsamen glutenfrei?</figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="To determine whether sesame seed products are gluten-free">To determine whether sesame seed products are gluten-free</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="you can refer to the following aspects">you can refer to the following aspects</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="Check Food Labels">Check Food Labels</span></strong></li></ul><p>Erste, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="carefully examine the product&#8217;s ingredient list and label">carefully examine the product&#8217;s ingredient list and label</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="If the product explicitly lists any gluten-containing ingredients">If the product explicitly lists any gluten-containing ingredients</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="it is not suitable for a gluten-free diet">it is not suitable for a gluten-free diet</span>. Zusätzlich, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="be on the lookout for statements like “may contain” or “produced on shared equipment with wheat">be on the lookout for statements like “may contain” or “produced on shared equipment with wheat</span>,<span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="” as these may indicate a risk of cross-contamination">” as these may indicate a risk of cross-contamination</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten-Free Certification Mark">Gluten-Free Certification Mark</span></strong></li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="Choose products that carry a “gluten-free” statement or certification mark">Choose products that carry a “gluten-free” statement or certification mark</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_158" data-source="" data-orig="Many countries and regions have strict standards for gluten-free foods">Many countries and regions have strict standards for gluten-free foods</span>; Zum Beispiel, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_159" data-source="" data-orig="the European Union stipulates that gluten-free foods must contain no more than">the European Union stipulates that gluten-free foods must contain no more than</span> 20 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_160" data-source="" data-orig="parts per million">parts per million</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_161" data-source="" data-orig="ppm">ppm</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_162" data-source="" data-orig="of gluten">of gluten</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_163" data-source="" data-orig="Some products may receive gluten-free certification">Some products may receive gluten-free certification</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_164" data-source="" data-orig="such as GFCO certification">such as GFCO certification</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_165" data-source="" data-orig="indicating compliance with gluten-free standards">indicating compliance with gluten-free standards</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_166" data-source="" data-orig="Testing Methods">Testing Methods</span></strong></li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="If you still have concerns about a product&#8217;s safety">If you still have concerns about a product&#8217;s safety</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="scientific testing methods can be employed">scientific testing methods can be employed</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="Common testing methods include Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay">Common testing methods include Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="ELISA">ELISA</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="a reliable and precise method for detecting gluten levels in food">a reliable and precise method for detecting gluten levels in food</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid High-Risk Cross-Contamination Foods">Avoid High-Risk Cross-Contamination Foods</span></strong></li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="Even if a product itself does not contain gluten">Even if a product itself does not contain gluten</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="you should avoid using foods produced on the same lines or in environments as gluten-containing grains">you should avoid using foods produced on the same lines or in environments as gluten-containing grains</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="as this could lead to cross-contamination">as this could lead to cross-contamination</span>.</p><p>Indem Sie diese Methoden befolgen, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="you can effectively identify sesame seed products that are gluten-free">you can effectively identify sesame seed products that are gluten-free</span>, Gewährleistung eines sicheren Konsums.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_All_Sesame_Seed_Products_Processed_in_the_Food_Industry_Gluten-Free"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="Are All Sesame Seed Products Processed in the Food Industry Gluten-Free">Are All Sesame Seed Products Processed in the Food Industry Gluten-Free</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seeds themselves do not contain gluten">Sesame seeds themselves do not contain gluten</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="therefore">therefore</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="they can be considered gluten-free unless contaminated">they can be considered gluten-free unless contaminated</span>. Jedoch, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="processing in the food industry can lead to cross-contamination">processing in the food industry can lead to cross-contamination</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="which might affect the final product&#8217;s gluten content">which might affect the final product&#8217;s gluten content</span>. Zum Beispiel, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="if a processing facility has a high risk of gluten cross-contamination">if a processing facility has a high risk of gluten cross-contamination</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="even gluten-free raw materials might result in a product marked as unsuitable for a gluten-free diet">even gluten-free raw materials might result in a product marked as unsuitable for a gluten-free diet</span>.</p><p>daher, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="consumers should carefully check product labels when selecting sesame seed products to ensure they meet gluten-free requirements">consumers should carefully check product labels when selecting sesame seed products to ensure they meet gluten-free requirements</span>.</p><figure id="attachment_632-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-632-2" style="width: 700px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Does-sesame-seeds-contain-gluten-300x182.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-632" alt="Are sesame seeds gluten free" width="710" height="431" title="Sind Sesamsamen glutenfrei?? 7" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-632-2" class="wp-caption-text">Sind Sesamsamen glutenfrei?</figcaption></figure><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_Sesame_Seed_Paste_and_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Contain_Gluten"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="Do Sesame Seed Paste and Sesame Seed Oil Contain Gluten">Do Sesame Seed Paste and Sesame Seed Oil Contain Gluten</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seed paste and sesame seed oil made from sesame seeds typically do not contain gluten">Sesame seed paste and sesame seed oil made from sesame seeds typically do not contain gluten</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="Most sesame seed pastes are gluten-free">Most sesame seed pastes are gluten-free</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="and there are gluten-free recipes for sesame seed paste that explicitly state they do not contain gluten ingredients">and there are gluten-free recipes for sesame seed paste that explicitly state they do not contain gluten ingredients</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="Similarly">Similarly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="sesame seed oil is considered a suitable condiment for a gluten-free diet">sesame seed oil is considered a suitable condiment for a gluten-free diet</span>.</p><p>Jedoch, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="note that some sesame seed oil products may contain gluten if they come into contact with gluten-containing ingredients during production">note that some sesame seed oil products may contain gluten if they come into contact with gluten-containing ingredients during production</span>. daher, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="it&#8217;s best to check the product label to confirm if it is gluten-free when selecting sesame seed oil">it&#8217;s best to check the product label to confirm if it is gluten-free when selecting sesame seed oil</span>.</p><p>Gesamt, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="sesame seeds and their products">sesame seeds and their products</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="such as sesame seed paste and sesame seed oil">such as sesame seed paste and sesame seed oil</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="are inherently gluten-free">are inherently gluten-free</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="but it is essential to pay attention to specific ingredient and label information when purchasing">but it is essential to pay attention to specific ingredient and label information when purchasing</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_Products_Make_with_Sesame_Seeds_as_Ingredients_Contain_Gluten"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="Do Products Make with Sesame Seeds as Ingredients Contain Gluten">Do Products Make with Sesame Seeds as Ingredients Contain Gluten</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="Whether foods made with sesame seed products contain gluten depends on the specific ingredients and production processes involved">Whether foods made with sesame seed products contain gluten depends on the specific ingredients and production processes involved</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seeds themselves are gluten-free">Sesame seeds themselves are gluten-free</span>. Jedoch, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="if sesame seed products come into contact with gluten-containing raw materials or equipment during production">if sesame seed products come into contact with gluten-containing raw materials or equipment during production</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="cross-contamination may occur">cross-contamination may occur</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="leading to gluten in the final product">leading to gluten in the final product</span>.</p><p>Zusätzlich, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="some gluten-free certified products clearly include sesame seeds as an ingredient">some gluten-free certified products clearly include sesame seeds as an ingredient</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="These products are typically processed under strict conditions to avoid cross-contamination and comply with gluten-free standards">These products are typically processed under strict conditions to avoid cross-contamination and comply with gluten-free standards</span>. daher, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="if sesame seed products are processed in a gluten-free environment and do not come into contact with gluten sources">if sesame seed products are processed in a gluten-free environment and do not come into contact with gluten sources</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="they can be part of a gluten-free diet">they can be part of a gluten-free diet</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seed products themselves do not contain gluten">Sesame seed products themselves do not contain gluten</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="but their use as gluten-free ingredients depends on ensuring they do not come into contact with gluten contamination sources during production">but their use as gluten-free ingredients depends on ensuring they do not come into contact with gluten contamination sources during production</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Reference"></span>Referenz<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="History of Chinese Food Culture">History of Chinese Food Culture</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li><li><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame">Sesame</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li><li><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_214" data-source="" data-orig="Beijing Youth Daily">Beijing Youth Daily</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_215" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li><li><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_216" data-source="" data-orig="Grain Brain">Grain Brain</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_217" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li><li> <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_218" data-source="" data-orig="Your Guide to Eating Well">Your Guide to Eating Well</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_219" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li><li><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_220" data-source="" data-orig="Safe Food Handling for Butchers">Safe Food Handling for Butchers</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_221" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li><li><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_222" data-source="" data-orig="Gluten-Free Foods">Gluten-Free Foods</span></em>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_223" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher">Publisher</span>.</li></ul>`} />
